{
  "_comment": [
    "A verbatim excerpt of LiteLLM's model_prices_and_context_window.json,",
    "kept so CI can exercise the price adapter without network access.",
    "",
    "Source: https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm (MIT). Only the fields the",
    "adapter reads are retained. This is a fixture, not the index: real",
    "imports should fetch the upstream file so the recorded artifact digest",
    "names the actual bytes that were read.",
    "",
    "text-embedding-3-small is included deliberately as a negative case: it",
    "is filtered out by include_models, and an import run without that",
    "filter must refuse it for having the wrong mode."
  ],
